WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:02.352
Roxy ran down the sidewalk.

2
00:00:02.353 --> 00:00:05.188
But she didn't see Lily Zusk anywhere.

3
00:00:05.189 --> 00:00:08.391
"I followed her through the booth," Roxy thought.

4
00:00:08.392 --> 00:00:10.350
"She should be nearby."

5
00:00:10.351 --> 00:00:15.190
Roxy went around a corner. "Aha! I see her!"

6
00:00:15.191 --> 00:00:17.428
Lily was standing at a bus stop.

7
00:00:17.429 --> 00:00:20.099
Lily spotted Roxy and ran.

8
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:23.401
"Stop!" Roxy shouted.

9
00:00:23.402 --> 00:00:26.711
Lily ignored her. Roxy flew fast.

10
00:00:26.712 --> 00:00:28.860
She zoomed past people.

11
00:00:28.861 --> 00:00:30.505
A restaurant door opened.

12
00:00:30.506 --> 00:00:33.011
Roxy quickly avoided hitting it.

13
00:00:33.012 --> 00:00:35.429
Suddenly there was a mailbox in front of her.

14
00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:38.590
"Ahh!" Roxy flew up and over it.

15
00:00:38.591 --> 00:00:42.944
"I can't believe I almost hit that! I didn't see it at first."

16
00:00:42.945 --> 00:00:46.585
Roxy flew up high.

17
00:00:46.586 --> 00:00:48.622
She saw Lily on West Street.

18
00:00:48.623 --> 00:00:51.122
Roxy dived down toward her.

19
00:00:51.123 --> 00:00:55.171
She reached out. Lily ran faster!

20
00:00:55.172 --> 00:00:57.848
"Ugh!" Roxy picked up speed.

21
00:00:57.849 --> 00:01:01.109
She reached out again, and Lily seemed to disappear.

22
00:01:01.110 --> 00:01:04.262
Then Roxy saw Lily just ahead of her again.

23
00:01:04.263 --> 00:01:09.421
Roxy was confused. "How is Lily moving so fast?"

24
00:01:09.422 --> 00:01:12.301
Alarms went off at Metro City Central Bank.

25
00:01:12.302 --> 00:01:15.423
The front door opened. Two men ran out.

26
00:01:15.424 --> 00:01:17.502
They carried large bags of money.

27
00:01:17.503 --> 00:01:20.924
Police sirens grew louder.

28
00:01:20.925 --> 00:01:24.325
The men jumped into a car and drove away.

29
00:01:24.326 --> 00:01:26.632
A bank teller ran outside.

30
00:01:26.633 --> 00:01:30.571
"Where are the police? Where's Rocket Girl?"

31
00:01:30.572 --> 00:01:34.061
Detective Smith was driving fast, chasing another car.

32
00:01:34.062 --> 00:01:37.194
"Where's Rocket Girl?" he said into his radio.

33
00:01:37.195 --> 00:01:39.566
"We don't know, Detective," an officer replied.

34
00:01:39.567 --> 00:01:43.480
"Mayor Bloom tried calling her a bunch of times. She didn't answer."

35
00:01:43.481 --> 00:01:46.365
"We need her help," Detective Smith said.

36
00:01:46.366 --> 00:01:49.477
"Three banks were robbed at the same time!"

37
00:01:49.478 --> 00:01:51.294
Another voice came over the radio.

38
00:01:51.295 --> 00:01:53.370
"Attention, all officers!

39
00:01:53.371 --> 00:01:56.232
The Metro City Art Museum was just robbed!

40
00:01:56.233 --> 00:01:59.553
Several valuable paintings were stolen!"

41
00:01:59.554 --> 00:02:03.588
"Oh no!" Detective Smith said.

42
00:02:03.589 --> 00:02:06.905
Lily Zusk smiled as members of her crew arrived.

43
00:02:06.906 --> 00:02:10.140
They all carried huge bags of money.

44
00:02:10.141 --> 00:02:12.861
"Excellent work!" Lily said.

45
00:02:12.862 --> 00:02:17.348
"Thanks, boss!" one man said. "We're almost done."

46
00:02:17.349 --> 00:02:19.547
"Yeah," another one said.

47
00:02:19.548 --> 00:02:22.910
"We just have a few more places to rob."

48
00:02:22.911 --> 00:02:26.083
"The plan is working," a woman said.

49
00:02:26.084 --> 00:02:28.487
"Rocket Girl didn't show up."

50
00:02:28.488 --> 00:02:31.172
"Of course Rocket Girl didn't show up."

51
00:02:31.173 --> 00:02:33.256
Lily pointed at the big sphere.

52
00:02:33.257 --> 00:02:35.926
"She's in there, remember?"

53
00:02:35.927 --> 00:02:37.881
The woman held up her hands.

54
00:02:37.882 --> 00:02:40.589
"I know! But what if she gets out?"

55
00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:45.341
Someone else gulped. "We'll all be in big trouble then!"

56
00:02:45.342 --> 00:02:48.469
Lily shook her head. "Don't worry about it.

57
00:02:48.470 --> 00:02:52.245
Rocket Girl is in a virtual reality right now.

58
00:02:52.246 --> 00:02:55.467
If she doesn't figure that out, we're fine.

59
00:02:55.468 --> 00:02:59.614
And she won't figure it out because she's too busy.

60
00:02:59.615 --> 00:03:05.914
She thinks she's chasing me!"

